:P HITSELREG_XY 100*um
:P HITSELREG_Z 4*um
:P SITE_RADIUS 0.5*um
:P MAXRANGE 49*um
:PS MATE_WORLD G4_WATER

:P WORLD_XY $HITSELREG_XY+4*$SITE_RADIUS
:P WORLD_Z $HITSELREG_Z+4*$SITE_RADIUS+2*$MAXRANGE
:VOLU World BOX $WORLD_XY/2. $WORLD_XY/2. $WORLD_Z/2. $MATE_WORLD 
:VIS World OFF

### Sensitive Detector
:ROTM RM0 0 0 0
:P SENSDET_XY $HITSELREG_XY+4*$SITE_RADIUS
:P SENSDET_Z $HITSELREG_Z+4*$SITE_RADIUS
:VOLU SDbox BOX $SENSDET_XY/2. $SENSDET_XY/2. $SENSDET_Z/2. $MATE_WORLD
:PLACE SDbox 1 World RM0 0. 0. 0.

